---
// Plain inline SVG so it follows the site's light and dark colours.
---

<figure class="olp-arch">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-title arch-desc">
    <title id="arch-title">How the pieces connect</title>
    <desc id="arch-desc">
      A phone and the companion app each connect to a server. Servers connect to each other. Call
      audio goes straight between the two ends.
    </desc>
    <g class="box">
      <rect x="10" y="20" width="190" height="80" rx="10" />
      <rect x="265" y="20" width="190" height="80" rx="10" />
      <rect x="520" y="20" width="190" height="80" rx="10" />
      <rect x="265" y="150" width="190" height="60" rx="10" />
    </g>
    <g class="title">
      <text x="105" y="52" text-anchor="middle">The phone</text>
      <text x="360" y="52" text-anchor="middle">Your server</text>
      <text x="615" y="52" text-anchor="middle">Companion app</text>
      <text x="360" y="176" text-anchor="middle">Other servers</text>
    </g>
    <g class="sub">
      <text x="105" y="76" text-anchor="middle">keys, handset, e-paper</text>
      <text x="360" y="76" text-anchor="middle">Cloudflare, Docker or the hub</text>
      <text x="615" y="76" text-anchor="middle">on any phone or computer</text>
      <text x="360" y="196" text-anchor="middle">knock, then talk</text>
    </g>
    <g class="line">
      <path d="M200 60 H265" />
      <path d="M455 60 H520" />
      <path d="M360 100 V150" />
    </g>
    <path class="line audio" d="M105 100 V125 H615 V100" />
    <text class="sub" x="490" y="116" text-anchor="middle">calls go straight between the two ends</text>
  </svg>
</figure>

<style>
  .olp-arch {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .box rect {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .title text {
    fill: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sub {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .audio {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }
</style>
